00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:18.785 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Dans la première phase

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.819 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de notre opération militaire,

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:20.820 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit ce général rusénéral rusénés

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:22.956 size:53% position:73% line:53%
atteint nos objectifs.

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:23.957 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Les capacités de combat

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:24.958 size:53% position:73% line:53%
