00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:34.034 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du Donbass."

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:35.035 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Cette région de l'est

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:37.103 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de l'Ukraine est convoitée

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:38.138 size:53% position:73% line:53%
